| Rerolling Loot Drop || Player ||align="left"|
Players will gain another chance at rerolling the loot [[Drop Table]] of a particular enemy that is affected by the abilities below. These abilities may act on the same enemy more than once to produce multiple loot drops. However, you cannot stack abilities of the same class (i.e. {{M|Pilfering Swarm}} and {{M|Pilfering Strangledome}}) to produce more than one loot drop.

;On Live Enemies
*{{WF|Ivara}}'s {{A|Prowl}}

;On Petrified Enemies
*{{WF|Atlas}}' {{M|Ore Gaze}}

;On Enemy Kill
*{{WF|Hydroid}}'s {{M|Pilfering Swarm}}
*{{WF|Khora}}'s {{M|Pilfering Strangledome}}
*{{WF|Wukong}}'s passive (Monkey Luck buff)

;On Enemy Corpses
*{{WF|Nekros}}' {{A|Desecrate}}
